  "title": "Permits and Inspections | Castle Rock, CO - Official Website",
  "text": "Permits and Inspections | Castle Rock, CO - Official Website\nSkip to Main Content\nDevelopment and Construction\nFire and Life Safety Permits\nSpecial Events / Mobile Food Vendors\nSystem Compliance Reporting Requirement\nFire Watch Information for Occupied Buildings\nSearch\nHome\nTown Government\nDepartments and Divisions\nCastle Rock Fire and Rescue\nPermits and Inspections\nPermits and Inspections\nFire and Life Safety permits\nThe Fire and Life Safety Division page is currently being updated. We appreciate your patience during this process.\nCodes\nCRFD is currently utilizing the following adopted codes:\n2024 International Fire Code, as adopted by the Town of Castle Rock\nCRFD-adopted amendments to the IFC\nThese codes and standards govern our fire prevention, inspection and plan review processes. Please ensure compliance in all applicable enforcement and operational activities.\nPermits and applications\nPermitting for construction, operation and life safety systems\nMobile Food Vendor application\nOperational Special event permit application\n(i.e., bounce house, tent, carnival / fair, exhibit, tradeshow, etc.)\nBlasting requirements\nCRFD Blasting Requirements (PDF)\nCRFD Blast Report fillable form (PDF)\nFor more information on:\nFire and Life Safety applications\nDevelopment and construction\nEnvironmental assessment report\nHAZMAT chemical reporting\nPlease\nemail the Fire and Life Safety Division\n, or call 303-663-3120.\nIf you are unable to access any portion of the documents on this page due to a disability as defined under\nColorado House Bill 21-1110\n, we are here to help! Please call us at 303-663-4440,\nemail the Town’s accessibility team\nor\nsubmit an accommodation request form\n.\nDevelopment and Construction\nConstruction Requirements\nBDA and DAS Installation\nUnderground Fireline / Fire Department Connections\nFlushing Flow Requirements\nFire Alarm System Specifications\nHood Suppression (Cooking)\nRequired Fire Sprinkler Permits for System Modifications\nBlasting Requirements\nFire Sprinkler Plans Specifications\nGeneral Construction Permit Information\nReinspection Fees\nExpired Construction Permits\nPenalties for Work Done Without Permits\nPlan Amendments\nFire and Life Safety Permits\nSpecial Events / Mobile Food Vendors\nSpecial Events\nMobile Food Preparation Vehicles\nSystem Compliance Reporting Requirement\nFire Watch Information for Occupied Buildings\nCareers with CRFD\nCar Seat Education\nBecome an Explorer\nPermits\nPublic Education\nStay Informed\nContact Us\n300 Perry St.\nCastle Rock, CO 80104\nEmergency phone: 911\nNonemergency dispatch:\n303-660-7500\nAll other questions, comments or concerns:\n303-660-1066\nFax:\n303-660-1069\nConnect With Us\nFacebook\nStay informed\nPulsePoint informs you of emergencies and can request your help when CPR is needed nearby.\nDownload the app\nand follow CRFD.\nCR Home\nParks & Rec\nWater\nPolice\nPublic Works\nDevelopment\nAccessibility\nCopyright\nNondiscrimination\nPrivacy\nSite Map\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by\nCivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
